## 🎨 Styling (OneOhm V2)

**Design tokens — NO hardcoded values:**

| Property | Standard |
|----------|----------|
| Base font | `text-[13px]` |
| Font weights | 400 body → 500 labels → 600 titles |
| Borders | `border-gray-100` (NOT gray-200) |
| Radius | `rounded-lg` (NOT xl/2xl) |
| Padding | `p-4` (NOT p-5/6) |
| Shadow | `shadow-sm` or none |

**NEVER use `font-bold` — use `font-semibold` max**

---

## 🧩 UI Patterns

| Use Case | Component/Pattern |
|----------|-------------------|
| Forms | react-hook-form + Zod + `<Form>` |
| Tables | AG Grid or `<Table>` |
| Loading | `<Skeleton>` or `<Spinner>` |
| Empty | `<EmptyState>` from shared |
| Errors | ErrorBoundary + `toast()` |
| Modals | `<Dialog>` or `<Sheet>` |
| Search | `<SearchInput>` from shared |
| Wizard | `<Stepper>` from shared |
| Status | `<Badge>` with variants |

---

## ⚠️ UX Safety

**STOP and challenge if design is:**
- Ambiguous or inconsistent
- Not scalable
- Missing loading/error/empty states

Think like an owner, not a ticket executor.

---

## 🚫 NEVER DO

❌ Business logic in components  
❌ Duplicate existing UI components  
❌ Inline styles or hardcoded colors  
❌ Prop drilling beyond 2 levels  
❌ Raw fetch — use `apiClient`  
❌ Missing loading/error states  
❌ `font-bold` — use font-semibold  
❌ `any` types — import from shared-types  
❌ Hardcoded org IDs or API URLs
